  - training environment selection
  - data augmentation
  - reproducible research
  - experimental design
abstract: >-
  Experimental research code and paired results for loss- and gradient-aware
  selection among stochastic training environments under limited candidate
  budgets. The repository includes online CIFAR-10/ResNet-20 comparisons,
  preregistered matched schedule interventions on Digits/SmallCNN, negative
  and failed tests, public result CSVs, and independent verification code.
  Reported effects are conditional on the tested tasks and protocols; the
  repository does not establish a universal optimizer, a unique causal
  gradient-novelty mechanism, worst-case robustness, or a GPU speedup claim.
